<title>POLAND: Mostostal-E ADRs listed on Berlin bourse.</title>
<headline>Mostostal-E ADRs listed on Berlin bourse.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish steel trader Mostostal Export SA said in a Wednesday statement its ADRs began trading on the Berlin Stock Exchange on May 26, 1997.</p>
<p>It gave no further details.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
